# kin/child/face/paint_stripes: the child's face paint: two short stripes on each cheek (the accent; the people's own paint)
# (KIN-CHILD, P2b wave 2; the child, STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role paint stripes
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 3
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -2 -8
|oo....oo

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -8 -8
|oo

view L key rest origin -2 -8
|oo

